      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "교전 훈련, 오늘은 반응이 계속 반 박자 늦었어요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Engage drills today, I kept reacting half a beat late.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0a161466-fcba-5048-96d3-453b1426b46b",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "오전 만남 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "cf1b462d-6b27-5e30-9c9c-7eef0bbf4fdd"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
